      "tags": ["analytics", "documents", "validation", "privacy", "utility"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "The allow-list uses `as const satisfies Record<DocumentAnalyticsEventName, readonly string[]>`, so a new event name fails to compile until its allowed keys are declared."
